###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#AggregatedPnode.participationCategory
cim:AggregatedPnode.participationCategory rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                          rdfs:domain cim:AggregatedPnode ;
                                          rdfs:range cim:ParticipationCategoryMPM ;
                                          rdfs:comment """Designated Control Area participation in LMP price measurement

'Y' - Participates in both Local Market Power Mitigation (LMPM) and System Market Power Mitigation (SMPM)
'N' - Not included in LMP price measures
'S' - Participatesin SMPM price measures
'L' - Participatesin LMPM price measures""" .


