###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ConductingEquipment.GroundAction
cim:ConductingEquipment.GroundAction rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                     rdfs:domain cim:GroundAction ;
                                     rdfs:range cim:ConductingEquipment ;
                                     rdfs:comment "Action involving grounding operation on this conducting equipment.Equipment being grounded with this operation. In case of placing a ground anywhere along a line segment, you must use the clamp (to get the distance from one terminal), so use the explicit relation with line segment. In all other cases (including placing the ground at a line segment terminal), reference to one or more conducting equipment is sufficient." .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ConductingEquipment.JumperAction
cim:ConductingEquipment.JumperAction rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                     rdfs:domain cim:JumperAction ;
                                     rdfs:range cim:ConductingEquipment ;
                                     rdfs:comment "Jumper action involving jumping operation on this conducting equipment.The conducting equipment that this jumper action will affect. In case of placing a jumper anywhere along a line segment, you must use the clamp (to get the distance from one terminal), so use the explicit relation with line segment. In all other cases (including placing the jumper at a line segment terminal), reference to one or more conducting equipment is sufficient." .


