               rdfs:comment "Death band (Kr).  If Kr is not zero, the voltage regulator input changes at a constant rate if Verr &gt; Kr or Verr &lt; -Kr as per the IEEE (1968) Type 4 model. If Kr is zero, the error signal drives the voltage regulator continuously as per the IEEE (1980) DC3 and IEEE (1992, 2005) DC3A models.  Typical Value = 0." .


