                                 rdfs:domain cim:OldSwitchInfo ;
                                 rdfs:range cim:CurrentFlow ;
                                 rdfs:comment "The lowest value of current that the switch can make, carry and break in uninterrupted duty at the rated voltage under specified operating conditions without suffering significant deterioration of its performance." .


