                        rdfs:comment "The offset from midnight (i.e., 0 h, 0 min, 0 s) for the periodic time points to begin. For example, for an interval meter that is set up for five minute intervals ('recurrencePeriod'=300=5 min), setting 'offset'=120=2 min would result in scheduled events to read the meter executing at 2 min, 7 min, 12 min, 17 min, 22 min, 27 min, 32 min, 37 min, 42 min, 47 min, 52 min, and 57 min past each hour." .


