###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#DiscontinuousExcitationControlUserDefined.proprietary
cim:DiscontinuousExcitationControlUserDefined.proprietary rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                          rdfs:domain cim:DiscontinuousExcitationControlUserDefined ;
                                                          rdfs:range xsd:boolean ;
                                                          rdfs:comment """Behaviour is based on proprietary model as opposed to detailed model.
true = user-defined model is proprietary with behaviour mutually understood by sending and receiving applications and parameters passed as general attributes
false = user-defined model is explicitly defined in terms of control blocks and their input and output signals.""" .


