###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#OldCrew.type
cim:OldCrew.type rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                 rdfs:domain cim:OldCrew ;
                 rdfs:range xsd:string ;
                 rdfs:comment "Classification by utility's work management standards and practices." .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#OldPerson.type
cim:OldPerson.type rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                   rdfs:domain cim:OldPerson ;
                   rdfs:range xsd:string ;
                   rdfs:comment """Utility-specific classification for this person, according to the utility's corporate standards and practices. Examples include employee, contractor, agent, not affiliated, etc.
Note that this field is not used to indicate whether this person is a customer of the utility. Often an employee or contractor is also a customer. Customer information is gained with relationship to Organisation and CustomerData. In similar fashion, this field does not indicate the various roles this person may fill as part of utility operations.""" .


