GSNONR Gas Steam Non-Reheat Boiler
GSREH Gas Steam Reheat Boiler
GSSUP Gas Steam Supercritical Boiler
HYDRO Hydro
NUC Nuclear
RENEW Renewable
SCGT90 Simple Cycle greater than 90 MW
SCLE90 Simple Cycle less than or equal to 90 MW
WIND Wind
PS         Pumped Storage""" .


