                                      owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                      owl:onClass cim:PU
                                    ] ;
                rdfs:subClassOf cim:ExcitationSystemDynamics ;
                rdfs:comment """The class represents IEEE Std 421.5-2005 type ST4B model. This model is a variation of the Type ST3A model, with a proportional plus integral (PI) regulator block replacing the lag-lead regulator characteristic that is in the ST3A model. Both potential and compound source rectifier excitation systems are modeled.  The PI regulator blocks have non-windup limits that are represented. The voltage regulator of this model is typically implemented digitally.

Reference: IEEE Standard 421.5-2005 Section 7.4.""" .


###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#ExcIEEEST5B
