###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#GovSteamIEEE1
cim:GovSteamIEEE1 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                  owl:equivalentClass [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.k ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onClass cim:PU
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.mwbase ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onClass cim:ActivePower
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.pmax ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onClass cim:PU
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.pmin ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onClass cim:PU
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.t1 ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onClass cim:Seconds
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.t2 ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onClass cim:Seconds
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.t3 ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onClass cim:Seconds
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.t4 ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onClass cim:Seconds
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.t5 ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onClass cim:Seconds
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.t6 ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onClass cim:Seconds
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.t7 ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onClass cim:Seconds
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.k1 ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onDataRange xsd:float
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.k2 ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onDataRange xsd:float
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.k3 ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onDataRange xsd:float
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.k4 ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onDataRange xsd:float
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.k5 ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onDataRange xsd:float
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.k6 ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onDataRange xsd:float
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.k7 ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onDataRange xsd:float
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.k8 ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onDataRange xsd:float
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.uc ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onDataRange xsd:float
                                      ] ,
                                      [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                        owl:onProperty cim:GovSteamIEEE1.uo ;
                                        owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                        owl:onDataRange xsd:float
                                      ] ;
                  rdfs:subClassOf cim:TurbineGovernorDynamics ;
                  rdfs:comment """IEEE steam turbine governor model.

Ref<font color=\"#0f0f0f\">erence: IEEE Transactions on Power Apparatus and Systems</font>
<font color=\"#0f0f0f\">November/December 1973, Volume PAS-92, Number 6</font>
<font color=\"#0f0f0f\"><i><u>Dynamic Models for Steam and Hydro Turbines in Power System Studies</u></i>, Page 1904.</font>

<b>Parameter Notes:</b>
<ol>
 <li>Per unit parameters are on base of <b>MWbase</b>, which is normally the MW capability of the turbine.</li>
 <li><b>T3</b> must be greater than zero.  All other time constants may be zero.</li>
 <li>For a tandem-compound turbine the parameters <b>K2</b>, <b>K4</b>, <b>K6</b>, and <b>K8</b> are ignored. For a cross-compound turbine, two generators are connected to this turbine-governor model.</li>
 <li>Each generator must be represented in the load flow by data on its own MVA base.  The values of <b>K1</b>, <b>K3</b>, <b>K5</b>, <b>K7</b> must be specified to describe the proportionate development of power on the first turbine shaft.  <b>K2</b>, <b>K4</b>, <b>K6</b>, <b>K8</b> must describe the second turbine shaft. Normally <b>K1</b> + <b>K3</b> + <b>K5</b> + <b>K7</b> = 1.0 and <b>K2</b> + <b>K4</b> + <b>K6</b> + <b>K8</b> = 1.0  (if second generator is present).</li>
 <li>The division of power between the two shafts is in proportion to the values of MVA bases of the two generators.  The initial condition load flow should, therefore, have the two generators loaded to the same fraction of each ones MVA base.</li>
</ol>""" .


