                                              owl:onDataRange xsd:float
                                            ] ,
                                            [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                              owl:onProperty cim:MarketRegionResults.selfScheduleMW ;
                                              owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                              owl:onDataRange xsd:float
                                            ] ;
                        rdfs:comment "Provides all Region Ancillary Service results for the DA and RT markets. The specific data is commodity type (Regulation Up, Regulation Down, Spinning Reserve, Non-spinning Reserve, or Total Up reserves) based for the cleared MW, cleared price, and total capacity required for the region." .


