###  http://www.iec.ch/TC57/CIM#PFVArType2IEEEPFController
cim:PFVArType2IEEEPFController rdf:type owl:Class ;
                               owl:equivalentClass [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                     owl:onProperty cim:PFVArType2IEEEPFController.ki ;
                                                     owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                                     owl:onClass cim:PU
                                                   ] ,
                                                   [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                     owl:onProperty cim:PFVArType2IEEEPFController.kp ;
                                                     owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                                     owl:onClass cim:PU
                                                   ] ,
                                                   [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                     owl:onProperty cim:PFVArType2IEEEPFController.pfref ;
                                                     owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                                     owl:onClass cim:PU
                                                   ] ,
                                                   [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                     owl:onProperty cim:PFVArType2IEEEPFController.vclmt ;
                                                     owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                                     owl:onClass cim:PU
                                                   ] ,
                                                   [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                     owl:onProperty cim:PFVArType2IEEEPFController.vref ;
                                                     owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                                     owl:onClass cim:PU
                                                   ] ,
                                                   [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                     owl:onProperty cim:PFVArType2IEEEPFController.exlon ;
                                                     owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                                     owl:onDataRange xsd:boolean
                                                   ] ,
                                                   [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                     owl:onProperty cim:PFVArType2IEEEPFController.vs ;
                                                     owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
                                                     owl:onDataRange xsd:float
                                                   ] ;
                               rdfs:subClassOf cim:PFVArControllerType2Dynamics ;
                               rdfs:comment """The class represents IEEE PF Controller Type 2 which is a summing point type controller and makes up the outside loop of a two-loop system. This controller is implemented as a slow PI type controller. The voltage regulator forms the inner loop and is implemented as a fast controller.

Reference: IEEE Standard 421.5-2005 Section 11.4.""" .


